msgid "Shadow"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:9
msgid "Shadow type"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:24
msgid "No shadow"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:25
msgid "Fake shadow"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:26
msgid "Real-time shadows"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:34
msgid "Fake shadow is a soft blob rendered under the product — cheap, and enough for most products. Real-time shadows are cast by the lights in the scene, and cost more to draw."
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:38
msgid "Shadow opacity"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:43
msgid "Shadow blur / softness"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:51
msgid "Soft shadow"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:55
msgid "The broad shadow cast by the product as a whole. This carries most of the weight."
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:57
msgid "Contact shadow"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:61
msgid "The tight darkening where the product meets the ground. Set to 0 for a product that should read as floating."
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:63
msgid "Vertical offset"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:66
msgid "The shadow sits at the lowest point of the product. Use a negative value to drop it to the floor below a product that hovers."
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:73
msgid "Use a dedicated shadow light"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:76
msgid "A light that casts the shadow without lighting the product, so the shadow can fall where you want it whatever is lighting the scene. Turn it off to cast from the product's own lights instead."
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:79
msgid "Shadow elevation"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:83
msgid "Degrees above the horizon. Low angles throw the shadow out to one side; overhead tucks it under the product."
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:85
msgid "Shadow direction"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:89
msgid "Degrees around the product, deciding which way the shadow falls."
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:92
msgid "Nothing is casting a shadow. The dedicated shadow light is off, and none of this product's lights are set to cast shadows — add a light and enable \"Cast shadows\" on it, or switch the dedicated light back on."
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:97
msgid "Add a ground plane"
msgstr ""

#: src/inc/admin/views/3d-settings-sections/shadows.php:100
msgid "An invisible surface under the product for the shadow to fall on. It sizes itself to whatever the shadow needs, including the long shadow a low angle throws. Turn it off for a product modelled with its own base, which already has somewhere to catch the shadow."
msgstr ""

